{"author":{"id":"6c7374a500bfd4cb191ae45b3f9d4b7a3d9d7f0324d04add217e8cbefeb7e1b9"},"ops":[{"type":1,"timestamp":1791881068,"nonce":"a1NHKWX/75BgXnyxjVqiL1rdmT8=","title":"ToggleSwitch drops inline SVG knob content","message":"Associated component: ashui-components ToggleSwitch. Its render currently creates an empty ui-switch-thumb and ignores HXX children, so developers cannot place an inline SVG in the knob or animate between state icons. Preserve the existing switch interaction, focus, disabled and size behavior; mount decorative children inside the thumb, center and size SVGs for Sm/Md/Lg, and provide CSS state hooks for an optional fade/rotation between persistent on/off icons. Verify pointer and keyboard activation and offscreen motion in both color schemes. SVG path morphing is a separate renderer capability.","files":null}]}